=================== p03_proliferation_mediator.py
P3b: REAL BIOLOGY THAT MOVES QC — young tissue proliferates (35% cycling), old does not (5%).
     Cycling cells carry more RNA (biology). metric = fraction of G2M-high cells / mean G2M score.

  content(G1,S,G2M)=(1.0, 1.4, 1.9)  metric=frac_cycling
  G0 PASS     no bias; attenuation depth_downsample −14% of the signal (passed to design adequacy as a power check) — reported, not failed
  G1 PASS     no confident QC imbalance in 2 assessable strata (worst point ratio 1.07x; alpha 0.05 Bonferroni)
  G2 STOP     no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it
  VERDICT: UNIDENTIFIABLE — no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it

  content(G1,S,G2M)=(1.0, 1.4, 1.9)  metric=mean_g2m_score
  G0 PASS     no bias; level shift extra_dropout -26% of the effect scale (no structure to classify it; the effect field equalizes depth between groups) — reported,
  G1 PASS     no confident QC imbalance in 2 assessable strata (worst point ratio 1.07x; alpha 0.05 Bonferroni)
  G2 STOP     no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it
  VERDICT: UNIDENTIFIABLE — no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it

