  G2 STOP     no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it
  VERDICT: UNIDENTIFIABLE — no estimand pre-registered: declare 'composition' (relative expression) or 'content' (total RNA / genes detected) — the correction depends on it

